Greetings,

Oracle will be hosting Connectathon 2017 in the historic
Agnews auditorium, in Santa Clara, CA, from
2/27/2017 - 3/3/2017.

http://www.connectathon.info

I will be adding the registration form and CDA soon.
We'll be keeping our "no registration fee" policy from
last year, but registration is required for those who
will be on the testing floor.

We plan to have an IB network for NFSoRDMA testing.
This network, along with any other noisy equipment will
be backstage.

Please contact our event coordinator,
Tina.Hartshorn@oracle.com, if you need
additional information or have special requirements.

If you have interest in giving a talk, we have the
upstairs conference room available.  Please send me
a brief abstract.

Feel free to forward this to other interested parties.

Regards,
